    "summary": "An integration test indexes a two-file TypeScript fixture through the indexer's own per-file steps (real parser, resolveRelations, store writes; no embedding) and the real cross-file resolver over a temporary graph store, then runs assembleCodeReviewGrounding with realGroundingDeps: the test file's entity is the imported function's only caller and its testsReaching entry. Undoing the t1 program-statement scan, making isTestFile return false, or skipping the cross-file resolver each fails it.",
